      "surnames": "Rodríguez Jorge",
      "title": "Director of Data & Analytics",
      "description": "I am a down-to-earth Data & Analytics Director driven by a genuine passion for solving complex problems, regardless of the technology or information available. I consider myself a pragmatic builder who bridges the gap between high-level strategy and technical execution across the entire data lifecycle. I thrive on the challenge of wearing multiple hats—fluidly operating as an analyst, scientist, engineer, architect, team lead, or project manager all at once—and I love it. This end-to-end immersion is exactly what gives me the deep technical credibility and operational weight required to steer department-wide technology and data strategies. My track record spans from establishing robust data governance and high-scale warehousing to deploying machine learning and near-real-time streaming pipelines. While I enjoy the capabilities of advanced data architectures, my focus is always on maximizing efficiency and business value. As a leader, I feel genuinely proud seeing the growth and progression of my team. My leadership focuses on driving operational efficiency and scalability through best practices, while fiercely protecting a safe, high-trust environment where people can elevate both their technical and soft skills. I deeply cherish knowledge sharing and aspire to keep learning with every role I take on, constantly expanding my expertise well beyond my own field.",
